  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0: place list fixed (49 Puerto Rico names had a broken character) and deduplicated so every place is equally likely; default generators no longer repeat each other on .NET Framework (#7); lists parsed lazily and thread-safely; new PersonNameGenerator(int seed) and PlaceNameGenerator(int seed); MaleFirstNames, FemaleFirstNames, LastNames and PlaceNames exposed as read-only lists; XML docs and nullable annotations; CensusListStripper and FileCompressor marked obsolete. Full history: https://github.com/m4bwav/DotNetRandomNameGenerator/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
